    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "다음에 나오는 고유 명사, 숫자, 어려운 단어를 참조하면서 영어로 받아쓰기를 하세요."
    },
    {
      "type": "hints",
      "text": "Dear Peggy. 20 acres five miles from town. living room, dining room, kitchen, four bedrooms,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "bathroom. barn next year. modern heating system Don corn wheat, vegetables. ten cows,"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "hundred chickens, sheep pigs. Nancy."
